==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Sliggoo|93}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*'''Gentle Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Psyduck|70}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

